<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Qwest Comms begun as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Qwest Comms begun as buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it started coverage of Qwest Communications International Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set 12- to 18-month price target of $40 to $45 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares were unchanged at 30-1/4.</p>
